      "body": "Hi @kaarelkivisalu,\n\nThanks for the MWE. I get the same error as you do.\n\nThe problem is that `lags_future_covariate` is not a component lag and should therefore not be handled at any point by `processed_component_lags`. I'll adjust the `if` statement in line 396 to take this case into account.\n\nThanks for pointing it out!"
